OL,3,GNEWSAWeapons link renaming call for    
OL,4,Auniversity building                    
OL,6,FA Newcastle University academic has    
OL,7,Fcalled for the establishment's oldest  
OL,8,Fbuilding to be renamed after research  
OL,9,Funcovered new information about links  
OL,10,Fto weapons dealing during the American 
OL,11,FCivil War.                             
OL,13,FA recent study found 19th century      
OL,14,Findustrialist and engineer William     
OL,15,FArmstrong, after whom the building was 
OL,16,Fnamed, sold more arms to the US        
OL,17,FConfederate pro-slavery forces than    
OL,18,Fpreviously thought.                    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
