OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWeapons link renaming call for    
OL,4,Auniversity building                    
OL,6,FProf Bruce Baker, who specialises in   
OL,7,FAmerican history at the university,    
OL,8,Fsaid it had to choose between upholding
OL,9,Fsocial justice and honouring Armstrong.
OL,11,FThe university said any changes would  
OL,12,Fhave to be considered through the      
OL,13,F"appropriate" channels.                
